    "text": "<p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Now function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math> </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now, for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,  finding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p>",
